     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Patient mii-exa-mtb-patient</b></p><a name=\"mii-exa-mtb-patient\"> </a><a name=\"hcmii-exa-mtb-patient\"> </a><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">Maxim Muster  (no stated gender), DoB Unknown</p><hr/></div>"
